# The launchd jobs that run on the Mac (Amendment A): every KEEP-MAC row of the disposition table in os/MANIFEST.md.
# Format: label-suffix <TAB> template path relative to os/ [<TAB> optin=VAR: installed only when VAR=1, ruling INSTALL-1]. Read by os/install.sh; the label is $OS_LAUNCHD_PREFIX.<label-suffix>.
